steps.text:
上面两式相减，可得

$$
f _ {x x y} \left(x + \frac {1}{2} h, y + \frac {1}{2} k\right) h + f _ {x y y} \left(x + \frac {1}{2} h, y + \frac {1}{2} k\right) k = 0.\tag{④}
$$

①式两边对 $x$ 求一阶、二阶导数，得

$$
f _ {x} (x + h, y + k) = f _ {x} (x, y) + f _ {x x} \left(x + \frac {1}{2} h, y + \frac {1}{2} k\right) h + f _ {x y} \left(x + \frac {1}{2} h, y + \frac {1}{2} k\right) k,\tag{⑤}

f _ {x x} (x + h, y + k) = f _ {x x} (x, y) + f _ {x x x} \left(x + \frac {1}{2} h, y + \frac {1}{2} k\right) h + f _ {x x y} \left(x + \frac {1}{2} h, y + \frac {1}{2} k\right) k.\tag{⑥}
$$
